  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "Hit-tooh！野球"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>阿&nbsp; &nbsp; 墨</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hit幾年</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">中晝食飯配布袋戲</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">史艷文大戰藏鏡人tī電視</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">時鐘到半暝</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">又koh趕緊電視開</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán ê囡仔tī美國拚tsiūnn壘</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">冠軍獎杯金sih-sih</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tńg來遊街高人氣</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">1984　美國ê洛杉磯</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">贏古巴ê歡喜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">二郭一莊加趙George</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">職業棒球mā開始</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">1992　奧運銀牌感動時</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">炮仔聲像響雷</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">大人ê野球　漸漸出頭天</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">開放職棒球員tng大器</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">比賽精采　球迷支持</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">世界排名uì頭koh排起</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">職業ê樹栽iáu-koh細粒子</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣　退出頭幾位</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">年年有期待　失望目屎滴</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「Tsiok想beh贏韓國」是撞bē破ê天</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄ bat贏日本　球迷心內疼thàng暝</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">絕望ê老球迷ǹg望無了時</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">今年各界lóng總看bē起</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kám koh是摃龜ê一年？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一場一場拚--落-去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">落眠ê熱情漸漸醒</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hit-tooh！Hit-tooh！拍--出-去！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">大聲huah　大聲叫　鼓勵台灣ê健兒</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雙殺兩个做伙死</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">勝利女神笑bi-bi</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit个冠軍來kah kám有遲？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">2024　一下等就是32年</span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgTxUlQUSXugjlsx9wXEcNioVrB6FXgUxtg70q1eBVxVjAJqlEimCzAAc8B6wYfr1Z82IxLraLtQCwTU3_mY6Xs7sjqxROi9z9dFtFhc13yk1BYO6UzvljPyZTMm4aWsB7Q4Lm9zbaQZCmp0es6_5crHHaZ9R46WyJQ13MUtncUkKYJrO2_8QNu4-Rmxq1_/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1371%E6%9C%9F_22.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgTxUlQUSXugjlsx9wXEcNioVrB6FXgUxtg70q1eBVxVjAJqlEimCzAAc8B6wYfr1Z82IxLraLtQCwTU3_mY6Xs7sjqxROi9z9dFtFhc13yk1BYO6UzvljPyZTMm4aWsB7Q4Lm9zbaQZCmp0es6_5crHHaZ9R46WyJQ13MUtncUkKYJrO2_8QNu4-Rmxq1_/w458-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1371%E6%9C%9F_22.jpg\" width=\"458\" /></a></div><br /><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a name='more'></a><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh-oj4pjXlqh0g-wtg0GJI4ztOB4X4CvR9tds6y-BDitMOyNTDR0m7UHiCKNpwOBXlkwyBC0h8mU-Gwvhg7YCMhpV53TaRa0B1OEJpfMhWkDwBYMSSQqpybLRWBkbh-nRyCkQEV8UrjIfVYII3ZsL-fiVwRNTT8AvxvTyfpKh-hZR2sjmUfSyJxPF200lji/s1424/371%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh-oj4pjXlqh0g-wtg0GJI4ztOB4X4CvR9tds6y-BDitMOyNTDR0m7UHiCKNpwOBXlkwyBC0h8mU-Gwvhg7YCMhpV53TaRa0B1OEJpfMhWkDwBYMSSQqpybLRWBkbh-nRyCkQEV8UrjIfVYII3ZsL-fiVwRNTT8AvxvTyfpKh-hZR2sjmUfSyJxPF200lji/w450-h640/371%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.png\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></b></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><b style=\"font-size: large;\">#做伙來唸詩 專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap台羅。</b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\n<br /></span></b></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; cursor: pointer; display: inline; font-family: inherit; list-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; touch-action: manipulation;\" tabindex=\"0\">#台文通訊BONG報</a></span><span face=\"&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> 371期，2025年2月出刊。</span></b></span></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: medium; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: medium; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle ii04i59q\" style=\"background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">#李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。 </span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
